jobs.description:
Are you looking to lead projects in various sectors such as food, pharmaceuticals, and industry? At Cyclops, you will take responsibility for delivering industrial projects, from concept to completion.

Cyclops is a project management company that supports organizations with investment projects, from initial concepts to full realization. The focus is on collaboration, quality, and sustainable growth — for both clients and employees.

About The Role

As a Project Manager, you are responsible for the full execution of industrial investment projects for external clients.

A Summary Of Your Main Tasks

- You manage projects with a strong focus on scope, planning, budget, quality, and safety, ensuring smooth and successful delivery;

- Translating client needs into practical and achievable solutions, you make a tangible impact on project outcomes;

- In this role, you coordinate and lead project teams, including suppliers, contractors, and other stakeholders, to reach shared objectives;

- Acting as the main point of contact for the client, you operate either as the owner’s representative or working within a larger project team;

- Your work spans a variety of industries, including food, pharmaceuticals, chemicals, and FMCG, ensuring diversity and challenge in your projects.

WHO ARE YOU?

- Preferably, you hold a master’s degree in engineering, or a technical bachelor’s degree combined with relevant experience;

- You have at least 3 years of experience in a project environment, either as an engineer or in a project/lead role;

- You show a proactive, hands-on mindset with a strong sense of ownership, and you are able to stay resilient while delivering high-quality work in a fast-paced environment;

- You have a strong attention to detail, a structured way of working, and the flexibility to travel within a reasonable distance to client sites;

- You are fluent in English and Dutch or French;

WHY CHOOSE CYCLOPS?

- You take ownership of challenging projects in a fast-growing, dynamic environment where your impact is visible from day one;

- You receive a comprehensive compensation package with benefits including a company car, laptop and phone, meal and eco vouchers, extensive insurance coverage, and a cafeteria plan;

- With access to coaching and tailored training, you continuously sharpen your skills and grow as a project professional;

- Growing together with the company, you are given real opportunities to develop your career as Cyclops evolves;

- Working in a team where collaboration, drive, and a positive team culture go hand in hand with delivering results.

👉 Apply now and become part of our team. Talk to you soon!

CYCLOPS is a project management and engineering firm that supports companies worldwide with their investment projects. All the way from the initial concept to the complete project realization. Our goal? Moving forward together.
